# tof_invalid_alt_hover.expect — only invalid ToF samples while hovering in ALT_HOLD: treated as a silence
# ホバー中（ALT_HOLD）に無効な ToF サンプルだけが続く: 出力停止と同じ扱い
#
# Chain: auto-takeoff (FLYING/ALT_HOLD) -> every ToF sample invalid (14.0 s) -> 0.5 s later Failsafe judges a silence
# episode ("only invalid samples while flying") -> FLYING -> LANDING -> blind descent -> touchdown (LANDING ->
# IDLE_GROUND) -> on the ground invalid is normal: the next ARM is accepted and the takeoff is cut again.
# 連鎖: 自動離陸（FLYING/ALT_HOLD）-> 全 ToF サンプルが無効（14.0 s）-> 0.5 s 後に Failsafe が出力停止の
# エピソードと判定（「飛行中に無効サンプルだけ」）-> FLYING -> LANDING -> ToF なしの降下 -> 接地（LANDING ->
# IDLE_GROUND）-> 地上では無効は正常: 次の ARM は受理され、離陸は再び打ち切られる。
exit 0
log_contains any "Takeoff complete → FLYING/ALT_HOLD"
log_contains any "Downward ToF silence episode: only invalid samples while flying"
log_contains any "Downward ToF unusable (only invalid samples while flying) in FLYING/ALT_HOLD → LANDING"
log_contains any "Blind landing: ToF silent, velocity loop"
log_contains any "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
log_contains any "Downward ToF unusable (only invalid samples while flying) in TAKEOFF/ALT_HOLD → LANDING"
order "Takeoff complete → FLYING/ALT_HOLD" "only invalid samples while flying"
order "in FLYING/ALT_HOLD → LANDING" "Blind landing: ToF silent"
order "Blind landing: ToF silent" "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
order "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND" "in TAKEOFF/ALT_HOLD → LANDING"
# Settled around 0.5 m until the run of invalid samples is judged (14.5 s): no climb before LANDING starts.
# 無効サンプルの連続が判定される（14.5 s）まで 0.5 m 前後に整定: LANDING が始まるまで上昇しない。
metric alt_mean > 0.40 in 13.0 14.0
metric alt_max < 0.60 in 13.0 14.6
# Touchdown speed of the blind descent (truth, measured 0.60 m/s; 0.69 m/s with the open-loop ramp); the
# closed-loop landing touches down at 0.3 m/s. Bound 0.8 m/s: a 0.6 m/s bound would pass by only 2 mm.
# The thrust of the descent without a ToF is at most 0.95 x the support thrust, so once the velocity target is reached
# the descent speed is set by that ceiling (0.05 g) instead of by the PI.
# ToF なしの降下の接地速度（真値、実測 0.60 m/s。開ループのランプでは 0.69 m/s）。閉ループの着陸は 0.3 m/s。
# 上限 0.8 m/s: 0.6 m/s の上限では 2 mm の差で通るだけ。ToF なしの降下の推力は高々 支持推力の 0.95 倍で、
# 速度の目標に達した後の降下速度は PI でなくその上限（0.05 g）で決まる。
metric descent_speed_max < 0.8 in 14.0 18.0
# On the floor after the blind descent (resting truth 0.021 m).
# ToF なしの降下の後は床の上（真値 0.021 m で静止）。
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 17.0 21.0
# The second takeoff (ToF still invalid) is cut 0.15 s after the estimated rise reaches 5 cm: the craft rises 0.20 m
# (with the 0.5 s persistence of FLYING it would be 0.39 m, and 0.99-1.24 m with noise n2), it does not climb away (a craft that climbs away reaches
# the ceiling). Bound 0.30 m.
# 二つ目の離陸（ToF は無効のまま）は、上昇量の推定が 5 cm に達してから 0.15 s で打ち切られる: 機体は 0.20 m 上がる
# （FLYING と同じ継続 0.5 s だと 0.39 m で、ノイズ n2 では 0.99〜1.24 m に達する）。上昇し続けない（上昇し続ける機体は天井に達する）。上限 0.30 m。
metric alt_max < 0.30 in 21.0 28.0
